<title>Iraq: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/iraq/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-iraq-2026-11-18T22:14:09.140Z</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 22:14:09 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Iraqi security forces have redeployed to Jurf al-Nasr and Jurf al-Sakhar to confront the Kataib Hezbollah militia and enforce a crackdown on oil smuggling, with Prime Minister Al-Zaidi threatening forceful removal. An IRGC commander arrived in Iraq for talks amid rising tensions with Kataib Hezbollah, while an Iran-backed militia tortured an environmental activist protecting marshes and detained a former PMF commander. Iraqi fighter jets struck ISIS remnants in Anbar and launched two airstrikes against the group in the same province. The government also ordered security steps for the Jurf al-Sakhar oil pipeline and referred pipeline violations to the judiciary. 396 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Le Monde.fr&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxQeE81RHNyWV9Jc2dPbDFQR29pcEhYZlJCc1JFR1JsT1ctM2h2MG1aaEJ0dGk3a3VobmtWYzMtWW45ZGNPaXF0YlFUbDQzMUZpRmVONzBsY2M1SS04b0VZVnZ3V2N6S0l4UC03MWRkSVdGWVN2czdYTWxab1phZC0wa2k1RHJLTTBHM2Jla1BpVW4tQkdUdWR1QWdkWlI3ZEVCQnozOS1HUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;NPR&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwgFBVV95cUxPVV95bnRSWlVFU1dhSExfODRXN3Q5b1d1VHZZT2Z5Tk1nXzJBUHBFUkNibzBIY1I5NkdoeFAyU1ltNE9tYTVONzA1Smt4YWxmNWlSeVh6ZjVmMVNhbDluZGFwSW1ocExKb3Q0a1g2dFZNWFk3Vy1xclZDd0lRTVlJSFdnUU1ka29SM2wwbVhpTDJITlJzcllObUV3bFNfejhJMlBpdS0xcjIzYzRjVHR5ZE9kQktzTWZiY2VUdXFFOVVudw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxNWGxKLXJCYXZBNkRldUExLWE5anBiQmgwVVdpMDBaSjNtZ0lNYkN1d01HclRKZGF5MElGMU5rcWJGYUJHUmVlcVpvOFZud09yUUhsNXFaTFhEdnpyT1NZRjJJdGtSc2NNOVlMQS1rTV